  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0:\n- SignedMediaNotice: signing and validation for the notices the media server sends a business (media-ready webhook)\n  - the reverse of SignedMediaUrl: the media server signs, each business validates with its published keys\nv1.0.0:\n- SignedMediaUrl: signing and validation for share-protected media urls\n  - signs \"<urlPath>|<exp>\" so unrelated query params never invalidate a link\n  - validation against one or more public keys for key rotation\n  - base64url helpers and public-key derivation for key publishing\n- renamed from Business.Lib.Service.JTigerNova.Security (namespace is now jtiger.security)",
